{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#card-zh","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的会话提醒插件，会在会话完成、等待授权或确认、出错或中断时，在页面右上角显示通知条并播放提示音。它通过订阅客户端 uiSession.sessionStatus 判断状态变化，并将通知浮层和“通知提示音”设置页接入 DSH。用户可以选择 12 种浏览器合成音色、试听、关闭声音或通知条、发送测试通知及恢复默认；通知会自动消失，也可手动关闭。适合希望离开屏幕时仍能留意 DSH 任务进展的 Web 用户。使用时需要浏览器支持 Web Audio，并先与页面交互一次以解锁音频；偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:479-555","lib/client.cjs:618-669","lib/client.cjs:37-152","lib/client.cjs:396-466"]}
{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#card-en","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify-sound adds DSH Web alerts for completed, approval-needed, and failed sessions. It registers an in-page toast and settings panel with 12 previewable chimes, mute and toast switches, a test alert, and reset. Preferences use browser localStorage; sound needs an initial page interaction.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:479-555","lib/client.cjs:618-669","lib/client.cjs:37-152","lib/client.cjs:396-466"]}
