{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#feature-1","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 的功能「会话事件提醒」：监听 DSH 会话状态，在任务完成、等待确认或出错中断时显示页面通知条并按设置播放提示音。通知最多同时显示四条，可单条关闭或全部清除。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:241-273","lib/client.cjs:479-515","lib/client.cjs:361-388"]}
{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#feature-2","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 的功能「提示音设置」：在“设置 → 通知提示音”中选择并试听 12 种合成音色，切换提示音和通知条开关，也可恢复默认设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:37-152","lib/client.cjs:396-466"]}
{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#feature-3","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 的功能「测试通知」：在设置页点击“发送测试通知”，立即显示示例通知并播放当前音色，方便确认提示效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:443-466"]}
{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#feature-4","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 的功能「本地保存偏好」：将所选音色和声音、通知条开关保存在浏览器 localStorage，重新打开页面时读取；存储不可用时保留默认值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:148-209"]}
{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#caveat-1","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 使用前须知：浏览器需要先有一次点击或按键交互才能解锁提示音；在此之前页面通知条仍可显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:649-658"]}
{"unit_id":"Su-1003__dsh-notify-sound#caveat-2","repo":"Su-1003/dsh-notify-sound","commit":"3511f114e9716ab9610b4e543f48c475606f4ac9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-sound 使用前须知：音色和开关偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage，不写入 DSH 宿主设置文档；存储不可用时设置仅保留当前会话默认状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.cjs:155-209"]}
